Title           EIDE 4.03 with PCI Bus Master Initialization
Version         OPENSTEP for Mach 4.2, EIDE 4.03 + Bus Master Patch 1
Description     EIDE 4.03 with a PCI bus-master initialization fix tested on QEMU PIIX3. Select Intel PIIX in Configure.app and enable Bus Master DMA. Install at /. Reboot after saving the configuration. This installs the driver catalog; it does not change your active controller automatically. Original EIDE files are retained separately for rollback. Other hardware is untested.
DefaultLocation /
DiskName        EIDEBusMaster
Relocatable     NO
Application     NO
LibrarySubdirectory Standard
InstallOnly     YES
DisableStop     YES
LongFilenames   NO
NeedsAuthorization YES
